From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Android Port <arena@arena.ai>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 08:21:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: sound: wcd937x: resolve refs without empty
 fragment; topaz micbias4

CI reported the WCD937x properties defined in
qcom,wcd93xx-common.yaml as 'unexpected' (while its required
list, micbias4, did apply) - the common schema is not being
merged for the unevaluatedProperties check when referenced
with an empty fragment. Referencing the schema without the
trailing '#' matches how the dtschema versions used in this
project resolve other cross-file refs. Also add the missing
required micbias4 property on the topaz codec (2.7 V like
the other three, downstream value).
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,wcd937x.yaml | 4 ++--
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225-xiaomi-topaz.dts          | 1 +
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,wcd937x.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,wcd937x.yaml
index f94203798..2a2137c1d 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,wcd937x.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,wcd937x.yaml
@@ -14,8 +14,8 @@ description:
   It has RX and TX Soundwire slave devices.
 
 allOf:
-  - $ref: dai-common.yaml#
-  - $ref: qcom,wcd93xx-common.yaml#
+  - $ref: dai-common.yaml
+  - $ref: qcom,wcd93xx-common.yaml
 
 properties:
   compatible:
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225-xiaomi-topaz.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225-xiaomi-topaz.dts
index 4fac37560..d41c98a8a 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225-xiaomi-topaz.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225-xiaomi-topaz.dts
@@ -349,6 +349,7 @@ wcd937x: audio-codec {
 		qcom,micbias1-microvolt = <2700000>;
 		qcom,micbias2-microvolt = <2700000>;
 		qcom,micbias3-microvolt = <2700000>;
+		qcom,micbias4-microvolt = <2700000>;
 
 		qcom,rx-device = <&wcd937x_rx>;
 		qcom,tx-device = <&wcd937x_tx>;
-- 
2.39.5

